Abstract: Figure 2 Survival of SCLC patients [Log Rank P= 0.61, unadjusted HR= 1.09 (95% CI: 0.88–1.33; P= 0.434), 
adjusted HR= 0.93 (95% CI: 0.72–1.20; P= 0.769) adjusted for: Site; Sex; ECOG performance status; first treatment; and 
